/*  meta-queries.x -- the compiler operations a project meta helper asks

    Generated by tools/gen-meta-queries.sh; do not edit. Each public
    `meta` function in lib/meta.x without a run-time form that
    etc/meta-helper.x does not define asks the compiler, which applies
    its own operation. The helper compiles this file after
    etc/meta-helper.x, as one unit.
*/

